  "description": "CR 603.4 / 700.4 / 111.10a / 701.27a / 712.6d / 702.12b: Sidequest: Hunt the Mark destroys up to one target creature as it enters; at its controller's end step it makes no Treasure when only their own creature died, makes one without transforming at two Treasures after an opponent's creature died, and transforms at three; Yiazmat, Ultimate Mark sacrifices another artifact to gain indestructible and tap itself, then survives Murder",
